  - m_Id: 1452847101714432
    m_Localized: 'Consumes a large amount of mana to bombard the target with starlight,
      dealing {HitPower} Light damage.

      Target gains one stack of Stellar Beacon.



      Stellar
      Beacon:

      Effect lasts 6 turns (stackable; duration refreshes when stacked)

      When
      Starlight Pulse hits affected targets, each stack of Stellar Beacon deals an
      additional {BuffPower} Light damage.

      This damage has reduced accuracy.



      <color=#aa7>A
      giant falcon woven from stars crosses the galaxy.</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 1844898196692992
    m_Localized: Stellar cycle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
