    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32005628472401920
    m_Localized: For 8 turns, all your actions cost 1 less AP (but cannot be reduced
      below 1).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1988413887160320
    m_Localized: 'Charges power for the next devastating strike.

      End turn,
      and at the start of the next {ChargeTime} turn, deal {HitPower} slashing damage
      to each enemy in range.



      AP regeneration is reduced by {APRegenDecrease}
      on the attack turn.

      The attack counts as an action, so no free movement
      on that turn.'
