      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 118413491876913152
    m_Localized: 'Agility reduced by 1.

      Damage taken from Corrosive Breath
      increased by 100% (per stack).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32004739426754560
    m_Localized: 'Deals {HitPower} bludgeoning damage.

      This attack generates
      increased aggro.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32004932385710080
    m_Localized: 'After any ally deals direct damage, you follow up with an additional
      {Power} water damage.

      Lasts 3 cycles.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32005358346641408
    m_Localized: Direct damage deals additional water damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32005459701997568
    m_Localized: Deals {Power} bludgeoning damage to all targets within 3 grids.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32006055003758592
    m_Localized: 10% chance when dealing direct damage to call a falling star, dealing
      additional bludgeoning damage to the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32006324596842496
    m_Localized: Restore health for each grid moved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32006559108767744
    m_Localized: Increases healing power of allies within 5 grids.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 4970555986485248
    m_Localized: 'Calls down divine hammer on distant enemies, dealing {HitPower}
      light damage.

      This attack generates increased aggro.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32002718481063936
    m_Localized: 'Heals target for {Power} HP.

      Then healing jumps to allies
      within 4 grids.

      Jumps 2 times total, reducing healing by 30% per jump.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 32003737873096704
    m_Localized: '[Resonance]: For the next 2 turns, you cannot use this staff.



      Instantly
      heals target for {HitPower} HP,

      increases target''s constitution by
      {BuffPower} for 8 turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7611097214279484359
  - m_Id: 3701115437260800
    m_Localized: Specify direction and charge up,\nlaunching the attack at the start
      of the next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3701164888104960
    m_Localized: Normal attacks build up energy,\nuse 4 energy points for special
      attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3701227492286464
    m_Localized: 'Can perform defense,

      but will end the current turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3701253471805440
    m_Localized: 'For 2 turns after casting resonance,

      one cannot use this
      staff''s active abilities.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4969904137117696
    m_Localized: 'Charge up and perform prayer.

      (Requires heavy weapon to
      be available)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4970898682093568
    m_Localized: 'Power increased.

      Can consume blessing light to perform special
      actions.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32001234314010624
    m_Localized: Restores mana to target (equal to 50% of this skill's mana cost).
